.TH COFF_INDEX_SYMTAB 3
.SH NAME
coff_index_symtab \- retrieve a symbol table entry by index
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <coff.h>
.P
.BI "coff_symtab_entry* coff_index_symtab(void* " coff ", int " index ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR coff_index_symtab ()
returns a pointer to the symbol table entry at the specified 0-based
.IR index .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the entry, or NULL if the index is out of bounds.